(1813425, 249361, 46056, '<td valign="top">The choice of a house of cards is a good subject - the UNO cards are unusual. I''m not sure I like the doll in the picture, though.</td>', 'The choice of a house of cards is a good subject - the UNO cards are unusual. I''m not sure I like the doll in the picture, though.', '2005-10-26 03:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813432, 247595, 46056, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this in its original colours.  The purple in the flower is fine for me, I''m just not sure about the purple "fur" to the bee''s body.   I love the light on the bee''s wings.</td>', 'I would love to see this in its original colours.  The purple in the flower is fine for me, I''m just not sure about the purple "fur" to the bee''s body.   I love the light on the bee''s wings.', '2005-10-26 03:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813448, 248185, 46056, '<td valign="top">I took a similar shot this weekend (but I submitted a different photo) so clearly I think the subject is great!  Shame about the stalk to the right of the subject flower.  Attractive, though.</td>', 'I took a similar shot this weekend (but I submitted a different photo) so clearly I think the subject is great!  Shame about the stalk to the right of the subject flower.  Attractive, though.', '2005-10-26 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813460, 248812, 4967, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t say delicate to me at all... in fact... it says the total opposite of "girls are delicate"  here they are getting dirty and competitive.  As a sports photo, I would suggest a higher shutter speed if possible... also make sure that you check for your horizon line to be straight... they would most likely not be playing soccer on a tilted field, so I hope that the fence would not be tilted... Fairly good emotion on their faces, especially number 13''s I''m not sure that this is quite clear either, but that may be because of lower shutter speed, or the focus may be in the wrong spot which happens easily when you are shooting at lower fstops to blur out the background... also check your exposures, the ball and the girl''s white shirt seem to be a bit blown out.</td>', 'This just doesn''t say delicate to me at all... in fact... it says the total opposite of "girls are delicate"  here they are getting dirty and competitive.  As a sports photo, I would suggest a higher shutter speed if possible... also make sure that you check for your horizon line to be straight... they would most likely not be playing soccer on a tilted field, so I hope that the fence would not be tilted... Fairly good emotion on their faces, especially number 13''s I''m not sure that this is quite clear either, but that may be because of lower shutter speed, or the focus may be in the wrong spot which happens easily when you are shooting at lower fstops to blur out the background... also check your exposures, the ball and the girl''s white shirt seem to be a bit blown out.', '2005-10-26 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813463, 248881, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this picture quite a bit.... what are you sniffing?  It doesn''t look like wine, but I may be wrong... Why did you choose to use the background color you did?  I think the tint throws off the color of the drink.  Good luck. -8-</td>', 'I like this picture quite a bit.... what are you sniffing?  It doesn''t look like wine, but I may be wrong... Why did you choose to use the background color you did?  I think the tint throws off the color of the drink.  Good luck. -8-', '2005-10-26 03:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813471, 248274, 4967, '<td valign="top">In my honest opinion this could have been a much better photo, I feel that there are quite a few things that could be improved.  First of all I am having issues with the focus... I can''t tell whether it''s bad focus, possibly poor lens quality, or extreme cropping, but either way, it''s just not sharp.  Also I think that the way it is set up leaves a lot to be desired, I think you might have been able to get a better angle on this subject... I do however like the blue and brown stripes at the top... I just maybe wish the bells took up more of the frame?  All of the wires at the left take my eyes away...</td>', 'In my honest opinion this could have been a much better photo, I feel that there are quite a few things that could be improved.  First of all I am having issues with the focus... I can''t tell whether it''s bad focus, possibly poor lens quality, or extreme cropping, but either way, it''s just not sharp.  Also I think that the way it is set up leaves a lot to be desired, I think you might have been able to get a better angle on this subject... I do however like the blue and brown stripes at the top... I just maybe wish the bells took up more of the frame?  All of the wires at the left take my eyes away...', '2005-10-26 03:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813474, 248736, 4967, '<td valign="top">I rather like this image... I think it''s different and interesting... The leaves work well to add to her look of hiding, and I like the color pallette you have left the image with.  I think it''s a well thought out and composed shot that is very attractive.  -9-</td>', 'I rather like this image... I think it''s different and interesting... The leaves work well to add to her look of hiding, and I like the color pallette you have left the image with.  I think it''s a well thought out and composed shot that is very attractive.  -9-', '2005-10-26 03:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1813481, 248309, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not really seeing this as fitting the challenge without your title.. and that rather bothers me... I feel that this image is lacking in something... perhaps something to add interest to it?</td>', 'I''m not really seeing this as fitting the challenge without your title.. and that rather bothers me... I feel that this image is lacking in something... perhaps something to add interest to it?', '2005-10-26 03:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
