(1814746, 248560, 44172, '<td valign="top">what a beauty, she has such nice coloring and the lighting is done well, she seems the same size as my 4 1/2 month old,  a true image to cherish no matter what it''s score or placing :)</td>', 'what a beauty, she has such nice coloring and the lighting is done well, she seems the same size as my 4 1/2 month old,  a true image to cherish no matter what it''s score or placing :)', '2005-10-26 13:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814808, 249606, 39349, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I''d love to know how this is done (with the egg). Lighting is a bit dark on the upper left but overall I like this shot.</td>', 'Interesting, I''d love to know how this is done (with the egg). Lighting is a bit dark on the upper left but overall I like this shot.', '2005-10-26 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814840, 248881, 31334, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative.  I found it to be very creative to be inspired by delicate smell, and to display that with a visual.</td>', 'Very imaginative.  I found it to be very creative to be inspired by delicate smell, and to display that with a visual.', '2005-10-26 14:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814885, 247215, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is a very disturbing image to me. I''ll be honest, I had no idea what the word "Ethnocentricity" meant so I looked it up.  After further review, I really don''t understand the definition behind "Ethnocentricity" and the statement on the woman''s chest. The only thing that I can come up with viewing this shot and the definition of the word is (and I''m guessing here) a woman socially bound against a relationship that isn''t socially acceptable?.?. <br/> <br/>Either way about the shot itself, the lighting here suggests a raw and moody element that to me speaks something in the way of a ransom photo. Either way it evokes pure emotion from the viewer be it good or bad it is a powerful statement.<br/> <br/>As I stated before this image disturbs me, with that said, I''m not voting down this picture because of the power it creates when one is viewing it.  I''m giving you a 7 for a striking, emotive, and demanding shot that captures the viewers attention.</td>', 'This is a very disturbing image to me. I''ll be honest, I had no idea what the word "Ethnocentricity" meant so I looked it up.  After further review, I really don''t understand the definition behind "Ethnocentricity" and the statement on the woman''s chest. The only thing that I can come up with viewing this shot and the definition of the word is (and I''m guessing here) a woman socially bound against a relationship that isn''t socially acceptable?.?.  Either way about the shot itself, the lighting here suggests a raw and moody element that to me speaks something in the way of a ransom photo. Either way it evokes pure emotion from the viewer be it good or bad it is a powerful statement. As I stated before this image disturbs me, with that said, I''m not voting down this picture because of the power it creates when one is viewing it.  I''m giving you a 7 for a striking, emotive, and demanding shot that captures the viewers attention.', '2005-10-26 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814914, 247475, 44172, '<td valign="top">a little too grainy for my taste but emily''s dress certainly is delicate - and it''s a very interesting image - good luck :)</td>', 'a little too grainy for my taste but emily''s dress certainly is delicate - and it''s a very interesting image - good luck :)', '2005-10-26 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
