(1817247, 249554, 29658, '<td valign="top">Composition is too central, but the colors are very nice.</td>', 'Composition is too central, but the colors are very nice.', '2005-10-27 04:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817257, 249220, 45922, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a very good picture. It sends an interesting message. The picture is very clear and sends out a good message that smoking is a habit. And how the skull simbolyzes that life is delicate. That is Brilliant! I understand your message but others may not. Next time, maybe try something easier, simpler. Otherwise than that, AWESOME PICTURE!</td>', 'Wow this is a very good picture. It sends an interesting message. The picture is very clear and sends out a good message that smoking is a habit. And how the skull simbolyzes that life is delicate. That is Brilliant! I understand your message but others may not. Next time, maybe try something easier, simpler. Otherwise than that, AWESOME PICTURE!', '2005-10-27 05:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817259, 249528, 45922, '<td valign="top">I like your idea of using a feather to show delicacy. Personally, that was the first thing that came into my mind, as well, but I thought that alot of people would do it. Maybe next time, think a little bit more outside the box. But don''t get me wrong, I love this picture. It''s clear and very detailed. AWESOME JOB!</td>', 'I like your idea of using a feather to show delicacy. Personally, that was the first thing that came into my mind, as well, but I thought that alot of people would do it. Maybe next time, think a little bit more outside the box. But don''t get me wrong, I love this picture. It''s clear and very detailed. AWESOME JOB!', '2005-10-27 05:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817260, 249391, 45922, '<td valign="top">Wow, you''re right this plant is very delicate. I like your idea. It''s very creative. The picture is clear, but the tips of the plant are kind of blurry, show that the picture is a little out of focus. Besides that, I love the picture. GREAT JOB!</td>', 'Wow, you''re right this plant is very delicate. I like your idea. It''s very creative. The picture is clear, but the tips of the plant are kind of blurry, show that the picture is a little out of focus. Besides that, I love the picture. GREAT JOB!', '2005-10-27 05:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817263, 246889, 45922, '<td valign="top">Wow it''s beautiful! You are a great photographer. I love your idea. Everything is perfect. It''s clear, it''s beautiful, it''s awesome! One thing, the greenish-blue specs on the leaf are a little distracting. Everything else is perfect. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Wow it''s beautiful! You are a great photographer. I love your idea. Everything is perfect. It''s clear, it''s beautiful, it''s awesome! One thing, the greenish-blue specs on the leaf are a little distracting. Everything else is perfect. Keep up the good work!', '2005-10-27 05:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817266, 248354, 45922, '<td valign="top">I like the flower. You are right, it is very delicate. Is there supposed to be an ant on the flower, because if there isn''t, it''s a little distracting. Otherwise then than, Great job!</td>', 'I like the flower. You are right, it is very delicate. Is there supposed to be an ant on the flower, because if there isn''t, it''s a little distracting. Otherwise then than, Great job!', '2005-10-27 06:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817267, 249549, 45922, '<td valign="top">Great job! This photo does show superb delicacy. The little piece of tree in the background is a little distracting, but the rest of the photo is just AMAZING! Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Great job! This photo does show superb delicacy. The little piece of tree in the background is a little distracting, but the rest of the photo is just AMAZING! Keep up the great work.', '2005-10-27 06:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817269, 249501, 45922, '<td valign="top">That is an awesome photo! It shows great delicacy! Your focus on the spider web really helps bring out the photo!  I really don''t know what else to say, except AWESOME JOB!</td>', 'That is an awesome photo! It shows great delicacy! Your focus on the spider web really helps bring out the photo!  I really don''t know what else to say, except AWESOME JOB!', '2005-10-27 06:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817270, 248185, 45922, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. I think the picture is beautiful, except some of the things in the picture are a little bit out of focus. Otherwise than that, you''re AWESOME!</td>', 'I like your idea. I think the picture is beautiful, except some of the things in the picture are a little bit out of focus. Otherwise than that, you''re AWESOME!', '2005-10-27 06:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817272, 247495, 45922, '<td valign="top">Wow! I Love it! I love the way you can see a little reflection in the drop of water coming off of the flower. Next time, maybe try something other than a flower, because a lot of people for this competition used flowers. You don''t have to use this suggestion, I''m just saying that you should think about it. Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Wow! I Love it! I love the way you can see a little reflection in the drop of water coming off of the flower. Next time, maybe try something other than a flower, because a lot of people for this competition used flowers. You don''t have to use this suggestion, I''m just saying that you should think about it. Keep up the great work!', '2005-10-27 06:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817274, 248433, 45922, '<td valign="top">This is the first picture of a waterfall that I have seen for this competition. Way to think creatively. Although a part of the waterfall is a bit brownish under the log, which is a little distracting. That''s just what I think. Keep up the great work!</td>', 'This is the first picture of a waterfall that I have seen for this competition. Way to think creatively. Although a part of the waterfall is a bit brownish under the log, which is a little distracting. That''s just what I think. Keep up the great work!', '2005-10-27 06:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817275, 247356, 45922, '<td valign="top">I like your picture. The only problem is, is that it is a little dark, it is a little hard to see. Otherwise than that, good job!</td>', 'I like your picture. The only problem is, is that it is a little dark, it is a little hard to see. Otherwise than that, good job!', '2005-10-27 06:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817276, 247028, 45922, '<td valign="top">WOW! I love your picture. It''s very, outside the box. You did a great job! The top of the sword is a little fussy, but the picture still looks great. BRAVO!</td>', 'WOW! I love your picture. It''s very, outside the box. You did a great job! The top of the sword is a little fussy, but the picture still looks great. BRAVO!', '2005-10-27 06:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817277, 247215, 45922, '<td valign="top">This picture is kind of creepy! I kind of see your concept, but the concept in your photo I think is a little unclear. Good Job Though!</td>', 'This picture is kind of creepy! I kind of see your concept, but the concept in your photo I think is a little unclear. Good Job Though!', '2005-10-27 06:23:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1817279, 248402, 45922, '<td valign="top">I find this picture, simply amazing. Yor should give yourself a pat on the back. I like how you can see the lights from the city reflecting off the water. This picture really catches your eye. Great job!</td>', 'I find this picture, simply amazing. Yor should give yourself a pat on the back. I like how you can see the lights from the city reflecting off the water. This picture really catches your eye. Great job!', '2005-10-27 06:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817280, 249106, 45922, '<td valign="top">I have seen so many pictures for this competition of flowers, but never the inside of the flower. That was very creative. The picture is a little fussy in some places, but it''s still a good picture.</td>', 'I have seen so many pictures for this competition of flowers, but never the inside of the flower. That was very creative. The picture is a little fussy in some places, but it''s still a good picture.', '2005-10-27 06:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817282, 246956, 45922, '<td valign="top">I like how you made it black and white and how the light reflects off of the glass. good job!</td>', 'I like how you made it black and white and how the light reflects off of the glass. good job!', '2005-10-27 06:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817283, 248495, 45922, '<td valign="top">Wow, way to think outside the box. You''re right endangered species are delicate. Your picture is beautiful, but some tips of the whiskers are a little fussy. But still the picture is superb!</td>', 'Wow, way to think outside the box. You''re right endangered species are delicate. Your picture is beautiful, but some tips of the whiskers are a little fussy. But still the picture is superb!', '2005-10-27 06:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817284, 248243, 45922, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, is that butterfly dead? Well the picture is good. Your butterfly idea is awesome. I just wish the butterfly wasn''t dead.</td>', 'Oh my goodness, is that butterfly dead? Well the picture is good. Your butterfly idea is awesome. I just wish the butterfly wasn''t dead.', '2005-10-27 06:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817285, 248928, 45922, '<td valign="top">I like your picture. The only thing is, it''s out of focus! A lot of places in your photo are not well defined. There is also a little glare from the sun that you can see. Otherwise than that, Good job!</td>', 'I like your picture. The only thing is, it''s out of focus! A lot of places in your photo are not well defined. There is also a little glare from the sun that you can see. Otherwise than that, Good job!', '2005-10-27 06:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817286, 249254, 45922, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, that squirrel is so cute. I like how you caught the squirel nibbling on a little snack. To me, this picture shows delicacy.</td>', 'Oh my goodness, that squirrel is so cute. I like how you caught the squirel nibbling on a little snack. To me, this picture shows delicacy.', '2005-10-27 06:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817287, 249606, 45922, '<td valign="top">What an interesting picture. I like the way you made the egg look sort of like a wiffle ball. It does show delicacy. The picture is clear, creative, and beautiful. Good job!</td>', 'What an interesting picture. I like the way you made the egg look sort of like a wiffle ball. It does show delicacy. The picture is clear, creative, and beautiful. Good job!', '2005-10-27 06:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817289, 247061, 45922, '<td valign="top">Wow! This picture is very unique! I love the idea of using an insect''s wing to show delicacy. The bottom of the wing is a little blurry, but the picture is still beautiful. Keep it up!</td>', 'Wow! This picture is very unique! I love the idea of using an insect''s wing to show delicacy. The bottom of the wing is a little blurry, but the picture is still beautiful. Keep it up!', '2005-10-27 06:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
