(1817330, 246715, 44860, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you don''t mean a blanket. But it''s in focus. And rose - not. Be precise while focusing - it''s a powerfull tool to pay viewers attention.</td>', 'I''m sure you don''t mean a blanket. But it''s in focus. And rose - not. Be precise while focusing - it''s a powerfull tool to pay viewers attention.', '2005-10-27 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
