(1817391, 248593, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whoha!  Holy reflection Batman!  Love this shot, cool enough to make me wonder if it´s fake but I of course gave you the benefit of the doubt.  Love it, gave it a 10 and it went straight to my favorites.</td>', 'Whoha!  Holy reflection Batman!  Love this shot, cool enough to make me wonder if it´s fake but I of course gave you the benefit of the doubt.  Love it, gave it a 10 and it went straight to my favorites.', '2005-10-27 08:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
