(1817482, 249442, 14614, '<td valign="top">goofy title -- great shot with the warm colors, soft light, frame-filling elements</td>', 'goofy title -- great shot with the warm colors, soft light, frame-filling elements', '2005-10-27 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817532, 248823, 31403, '<td valign="top">the image is much more profound than the title gives it credit for - I really like this, but I''m sure many many voters don''t.  It just makes it art - something this site doesn''t really reward.  Do a whole series of flowers like this, frame them and sell them as sets.  <br/> <br/>I''d personally crop the white space off of the right hand side so the space between the blossom and the right edge is the same as the space between the stem and the left edge.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'the image is much more profound than the title gives it credit for - I really like this, but I''m sure many many voters don''t.  It just makes it art - something this site doesn''t really reward.  Do a whole series of flowers like this, frame them and sell them as sets.   I''d personally crop the white space off of the right hand side so the space between the blossom and the right edge is the same as the space between the stem and the left edge. 8', '2005-10-27 10:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817535, 248147, 31403, '<td valign="top">more contrast would make this a stronger image - cute kid - cute expression - I''ll bet it was fun to shoot this</td>', 'more contrast would make this a stronger image - cute kid - cute expression - I''ll bet it was fun to shoot this', '2005-10-27 10:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817547, 249280, 24503, '<td valign="top">wonderful picture</td>', 'wonderful picture', '2005-10-27 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817549, 249543, 31403, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition, the lighting is just a little off.  I wish I was better at lighting so I could tell you what I don''t like about it.  I think I''d rather see this with a higher contrast - so the background as black, the shadows darker, more highlight on the hand.<br/> <br/>But I love the curves, the highlights in the satin, the arch of the hand.  This is very nice work  7</td>', 'This is a great composition, the lighting is just a little off.  I wish I was better at lighting so I could tell you what I don''t like about it.  I think I''d rather see this with a higher contrast - so the background as black, the shadows darker, more highlight on the hand. But I love the curves, the highlights in the satin, the arch of the hand.  This is very nice work  7', '2005-10-27 10:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817550, 248283, 24503, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-10-27 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817562, 246715, 31403, '<td valign="top">the rose is out of focus, and the background is distracting - with the focus on the rose and the top cropped down to the blanket this would be a stronger photo</td>', 'the rose is out of focus, and the background is distracting - with the focus on the rose and the top cropped down to the blanket this would be a stronger photo', '2005-10-27 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817572, 248449, 30049, '<td valign="top">Either he is having a funny dream, or is trying really hard not to ham it up for the camera.  ;^)</td>', 'Either he is having a funny dream, or is trying really hard not to ham it up for the camera.  ;^)', '2005-10-27 10:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817577, 248283, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great job! Nice comp and perfect lighting</td>', 'Great job! Nice comp and perfect lighting', '2005-10-27 10:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817582, 249315, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the lighting in the background, and around the edges of the hand - a bounce card filling in teh shadows on top would make this nice IMO - beautiful shot -</td>', 'love the lighting in the background, and around the edges of the hand - a bounce card filling in teh shadows on top would make this nice IMO - beautiful shot -', '2005-10-27 10:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817585, 248118, 33672, '<td valign="top">Powerless???  My buddies tried to takle one one drunken evening in a vineyard.... I took them to the hospital.  Great capture</td>', 'Powerless???  My buddies tried to takle one one drunken evening in a vineyard.... I took them to the hospital.  Great capture', '2005-10-27 10:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817595, 249137, 30049, '<td valign="top">I understand your approach with the Black Sea being delicate in your opinion.  Cool, gotcha.  <br/> <br/>The image composition is nearly correct by including the foreground grass as you have and the beach waterline makes a nice diagonal line.  One thing you missed was the orientation as the image is tilted - needs to be rotated CW about 2 degrees to straighten the horizon.<br/> <br/>Something you may want to consider is the time of day for this photo.  Being mid-afternoon the lighting is flat and the sky is hazy.  A UV filter on your camera would help the haze and a polarizer could bring out the clouds a little more.  If your camera can''t use filters then timing is even more critical.  Early or late day sun will cast some shadows and give more depth to the image, especially the foreground in this case.  If none of the above options are available then in post-processing add some contrast and play with highlights/shadows some...<br/> <br/>Oh BTW - don''t forget to turn off the date/time stamp!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I understand your approach with the Black Sea being delicate in your opinion.  Cool, gotcha.   The image composition is nearly correct by including the foreground grass as you have and the beach waterline makes a nice diagonal line.  One thing you missed was the orientation as the image is tilted - needs to be rotated CW about 2 degrees to straighten the horizon. Something you may want to consider is the time of day for this photo.  Being mid-afternoon the lighting is flat and the sky is hazy.  A UV filter on your camera would help the haze and a polarizer could bring out the clouds a little more.  If your camera can''t use filters then timing is even more critical.  Early or late day sun will cast some shadows and give more depth to the image, especially the foreground in this case.  If none of the above options are available then in post-processing add some contrast and play with highlights/shadows some... Oh BTW - don''t forget to turn off the date/time stamp!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-27 11:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817596, 249313, 31403, '<td valign="top">out of focus and visually busy background make this hard to give a good score to - I''ll bet she has great stories to tell</td>', 'out of focus and visually busy background make this hard to give a good score to - I''ll bet she has great stories to tell', '2005-10-27 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817598, 248767, 45435, '<td valign="top">You take nice pictures but I don''t see anything delicate here and I didn''t think your reflections submission was a very good reflection either. Your Corner of the World picture was a better reflection. I''m trying to make this constructive so don''t take it the wrong way. You''re an excellent photographer but I don''t see the challenge criteria being met. Apparently, I''m in the minority because you have a bunch of ribbons. Perhaps it''s best if you just ignore my comments.</td>', 'You take nice pictures but I don''t see anything delicate here and I didn''t think your reflections submission was a very good reflection either. Your Corner of the World picture was a better reflection. I''m trying to make this constructive so don''t take it the wrong way. You''re an excellent photographer but I don''t see the challenge criteria being met. Apparently, I''m in the minority because you have a bunch of ribbons. Perhaps it''s best if you just ignore my comments.', '2005-10-27 11:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817600, 249557, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very fitting for the theme, only qualms I have with the picture is that it would look so much more "commercial" if the vial had been clean but other than that pretty good.</td>', 'Very fitting for the theme, only qualms I have with the picture is that it would look so much more "commercial" if the vial had been clean but other than that pretty good.', '2005-10-27 11:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
