(1817606, 247215, 26756, '<td valign="top">hanneke?  I think you''re going to get torn apart on this unfortunately.  Most people are going to interpret "delicate" as a physical thing that can easily be broken or damaged, like glass or a flower.  To me, this shows the fragile state of existence that is the female pysche lol.  ( I''ll catch hell for that later).    Interesting picture, good luck.</td>', 'hanneke?  I think you''re going to get torn apart on this unfortunately.  Most people are going to interpret "delicate" as a physical thing that can easily be broken or damaged, like glass or a flower.  To me, this shows the fragile state of existence that is the female pysche lol.  ( I''ll catch hell for that later).    Interesting picture, good luck.', '2005-10-27 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817608, 249442, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very nice, detailed study of something very simple.  Nicely backlit without being over blown.  The few that are lit well, in contrast to the others that are in shadow looks very nice.</td>', 'Very nice, detailed study of something very simple.  Nicely backlit without being over blown.  The few that are lit well, in contrast to the others that are in shadow looks very nice.', '2005-10-27 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1817610, 249321, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting message - certainly appropriate for the challenge theme, and clever at that.<br/> <br/>The story is a bit muddled.  It''s evident that somebody is missing some clothes and something sexy is going on.  But, did they or didn''t they?  If they did then tsk-tsk on them as the condom package is unopened.  If they didn''t then why are the clothes still there?<br/> <br/>Point I''m trying to make in a VERY long-winded manner...the package should have been open and empty with the way this is currently setup.  JMO of course.  And something to indicate a man is present (discarded clothing - maybe a tie) would help also.<br/> <br/>Technically the image is fine.  The condom package is focal and positioned using ROT.  Lighting and focus is right on.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting message - certainly appropriate for the challenge theme, and clever at that. The story is a bit muddled.  It''s evident that somebody is missing some clothes and something sexy is going on.  But, did they or didn''t they?  If they did then tsk-tsk on them as the condom package is unopened.  If they didn''t then why are the clothes still there? Point I''m trying to make in a VERY long-winded manner...the package should have been open and empty with the way this is currently setup.  JMO of course.  And something to indicate a man is present (discarded clothing - maybe a tie) would help also. Technically the image is fine.  The condom package is focal and positioned using ROT.  Lighting and focus is right on. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-27 11:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
