(1820525, 248983, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall I like your photo. The sky is so expansive and great colors. It did take my eyes a moment or two to actually see the peaks in the background. The foreground silhouettes are so strong against the sky those peaks just blend right in. I don''t get an overwhelming delicate sense as compared with other entries, but a really nice photo.</td>', 'Overall I like your photo. The sky is so expansive and great colors. It did take my eyes a moment or two to actually see the peaks in the background. The foreground silhouettes are so strong against the sky those peaks just blend right in. I don''t get an overwhelming delicate sense as compared with other entries, but a really nice photo.', '2005-10-28 09:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820526, 249124, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for insects, but this is a cool shot. 10</td>', 'I don''t care for insects, but this is a cool shot. 10', '2005-10-28 09:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820633, 249589, 5391, '<td valign="top">Moody image with beautiful lighting and composition.  The dark, contrasting colors work really well together.  The blown out white spots are a bit of a distraction, but other than that, this is great!</td>', 'Moody image with beautiful lighting and composition.  The dark, contrasting colors work really well together.  The blown out white spots are a bit of a distraction, but other than that, this is great!', '2005-10-28 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820641, 249337, 5391, '<td valign="top">A bit of fill flash to highlight the detail in that center would have been great here, but it''s a very nice image.  Normally, centered flower compositions don''t work well, but the leading lines of the petals really add to this.</td>', 'A bit of fill flash to highlight the detail in that center would have been great here, but it''s a very nice image.  Normally, centered flower compositions don''t work well, but the leading lines of the petals really add to this.', '2005-10-28 10:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820645, 249395, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, composed and good tonal range.  A tiny bit more light on the egg to make it "pop" from the background would make this a 10.  8</td>', 'Nicely lit, composed and good tonal range.  A tiny bit more light on the egg to make it "pop" from the background would make this a 10.  8', '2005-10-28 10:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820650, 249229, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - stunning, beautiful portrait.  Great use of depth of field, beautiful composition.  Just a tiny, bright catchlight in the eyes is the only thing I can think of that could improve this at all.  Gorgeous.  9</td>', 'Wow - stunning, beautiful portrait.  Great use of depth of field, beautiful composition.  Just a tiny, bright catchlight in the eyes is the only thing I can think of that could improve this at all.  Gorgeous.  9', '2005-10-28 10:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820671, 248881, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image, EXCELLENT job on the lighting (I hate seeing great shots like this ruined with bad reflections in the glass), and nice composition.  The printing on the glass is the only distraction.  8</td>', 'Very pretty image, EXCELLENT job on the lighting (I hate seeing great shots like this ruined with bad reflections in the glass), and nice composition.  The printing on the glass is the only distraction.  8', '2005-10-28 10:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820684, 248497, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tonal range and a great shot.  The little teddy bear picture is a distraction - my eyes keep being drawn to it - but otherwise, it''s a beautiful image.  8</td>', 'Beautiful tonal range and a great shot.  The little teddy bear picture is a distraction - my eyes keep being drawn to it - but otherwise, it''s a beautiful image.  8', '2005-10-28 10:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820692, 248983, 29949, '<td valign="top">nice sky</td>', 'nice sky', '2005-10-28 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820694, 248856, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The lines created between the bright clouds, horse and tree silhouettes make for a very pleasing composition.  I''d like to see it just a touch sharper.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The lines created between the bright clouds, horse and tree silhouettes make for a very pleasing composition.  I''d like to see it just a touch sharper.', '2005-10-28 11:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820698, 248560, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  One of the better "baby" shots of the challenge.  Nice lighting, very sweet picture.  8</td>', 'Beautiful!  One of the better "baby" shots of the challenge.  Nice lighting, very sweet picture.  8', '2005-10-28 11:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820704, 247313, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2005-10-28 11:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820716, 249516, 5391, '<td valign="top">We have a ribbon!  :)  The way the color on the wood ties your eyes to her hair, the beautiful tonal range and the composition all work so well together, here.  And easy 10.  Great photograph.</td>', 'We have a ribbon!  :)  The way the color on the wood ties your eyes to her hair, the beautiful tonal range and the composition all work so well together, here.  And easy 10.  Great photograph.', '2005-10-28 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820725, 248361, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  The tiny leaf juxtaposed against the hand works well, and the lighting and diagonal composition are perfect.  9</td>', 'Very, very nice.  The tiny leaf juxtaposed against the hand works well, and the lighting and diagonal composition are perfect.  9', '2005-10-28 11:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820732, 249483, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is hauntingly beautiful.. The snow coming down looks more like a rainshower to me but the muted tones and foggy background makes me want to sit in front of a fireplace with a hot drink!  Nice artistic work!</td>', 'This is hauntingly beautiful.. The snow coming down looks more like a rainshower to me but the muted tones and foggy background makes me want to sit in front of a fireplace with a hot drink!  Nice artistic work!', '2005-10-28 11:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820743, 249543, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is nice in composition but the lights/hot spots are distracting and the highlights on the red satin seem either oversaturated or too reflective from the lighting.  Also, red doesn''t evoke a  "delicate" feel. It''s more seductive. This whole photo has a "come hither" feel to it, which is far from delicate!   It would have been better, IMHO, if  you would have used lighterfabrics with a  gossimier sheen or laces.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is nice in composition but the lights/hot spots are distracting and the highlights on the red satin seem either oversaturated or too reflective from the lighting.  Also, red doesn''t evoke a  "delicate" feel. It''s more seductive. This whole photo has a "come hither" feel to it, which is far from delicate!   It would have been better, IMHO, if  you would have used lighterfabrics with a  gossimier sheen or laces.  Nice work.', '2005-10-28 11:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820746, 249180, 39664, '<td valign="top">AWWWWWW!  Now that little one is so delicate!  The only thought that keeps going through my mind is AWWWWWWW!  God Bless you for being mom to this kitten!</td>', 'AWWWWWW!  Now that little one is so delicate!  The only thought that keeps going through my mind is AWWWWWWW!  God Bless you for being mom to this kitten!', '2005-10-28 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820753, 249405, 39664, '<td valign="top">How wonderful!  A douible rainbow!  And how lucky you are to have captured it so well!  Nice work!</td>', 'How wonderful!  A douible rainbow!  And how lucky you are to have captured it so well!  Nice work!', '2005-10-28 11:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820754, 249245, 39664, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t work for me, sorry.  The high key attempt hurts my eyes.</td>', 'This just doesn''t work for me, sorry.  The high key attempt hurts my eyes.', '2005-10-28 11:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820760, 248736, 39664, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  the maiden in the garden appears to be hiding her nudity behind the bushes.  love the colors and comp.</td>', 'Very nice.  the maiden in the garden appears to be hiding her nudity behind the bushes.  love the colors and comp.', '2005-10-28 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820779, 249468, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love all the negetive space and the lighting and everything!  10+</td>', 'Wow!  Love all the negetive space and the lighting and everything!  10+', '2005-10-28 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820784, 248593, 29949, '<td valign="top">interesting......i like it</td>', 'interesting......i like it', '2005-10-28 11:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820785, 247925, 39664, '<td valign="top">She looks like Drew Barrymore!</td>', 'She looks like Drew Barrymore!', '2005-10-28 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820788, 248594, 39664, '<td valign="top">Love the gossimier wings!</td>', 'Love the gossimier wings!', '2005-10-28 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820791, 249212, 39664, '<td valign="top">The midtones have this blueish cast to the whites of this hydrangea.  If you could have gotten it all white with the delicate light yellows and no blueish cast, this would have been more effective, IMHO.</td>', 'The midtones have this blueish cast to the whites of this hydrangea.  If you could have gotten it all white with the delicate light yellows and no blueish cast, this would have been more effective, IMHO.', '2005-10-28 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820794, 247157, 39664, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp and clear!</td>', 'Nice crisp and clear!', '2005-10-28 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820796, 247455, 39664, '<td valign="top">Too centered and your horizon seems to tilt to the left.</td>', 'Too centered and your horizon seems to tilt to the left.', '2005-10-28 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820798, 246710, 39664, '<td valign="top">A different angle would have worked better, IMHO.  Your DOF is good and I love the blurry conterpart in the background but the one is focus is too centered.</td>', 'A different angle would have worked better, IMHO.  Your DOF is good and I love the blurry conterpart in the background but the one is focus is too centered.', '2005-10-28 11:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820801, 249241, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is so creative and sooo emotion evoking!  There are so many ways to interpret this photo.  Awesome set up and awesome execution!  Very creative!  I hope this finishes high!</td>', 'Wow!  This is so creative and sooo emotion evoking!  There are so many ways to interpret this photo.  Awesome set up and awesome execution!  Very creative!  I hope this finishes high!', '2005-10-28 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820804, 249414, 39664, '<td valign="top">I spot some icky looking fruit.  If it is rotting or oversharpened, I can''t tell but it definitely detracts from the delicacy of the butterfly''s wings.</td>', 'I spot some icky looking fruit.  If it is rotting or oversharpened, I can''t tell but it definitely detracts from the delicacy of the butterfly''s wings.', '2005-10-28 11:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820806, 248009, 39664, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection photo.  Those suckers can be mean as heck!</td>', 'Nice reflection photo.  Those suckers can be mean as heck!', '2005-10-28 11:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820809, 249442, 39664, '<td valign="top">Pretty grasses.</td>', 'Pretty grasses.', '2005-10-28 11:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820813, 247189, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow, she looks about done!  Her "turkey timer" has popped!  LOL! <br/> <br/>A lovely rendering of a raidian mother.  Congratulations on the up coming event and God Bless!</td>', 'Wow, she looks about done!  Her "turkey timer" has popped!  LOL!  A lovely rendering of a raidian mother.  Congratulations on the up coming event and God Bless!', '2005-10-28 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820815, 248560, 39664, '<td valign="top">She looks like a living doll!</td>', 'She looks like a living doll!', '2005-10-28 11:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820817, 248812, 39664, '<td valign="top">Tongue in cheek?</td>', 'Tongue in cheek?', '2005-10-28 11:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820820, 248350, 39664, '<td valign="top">He is not one to be messed with!  Awesome work!</td>', 'He is not one to be messed with!  Awesome work!', '2005-10-28 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820823, 248982, 39664, '<td valign="top">Cool idea but your lighting is off....too harsh</td>', 'Cool idea but your lighting is off....too harsh', '2005-10-28 12:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820826, 248984, 39664, '<td valign="top">The soft focus doesn''t work here for me.  It just looks rather blurry and without detail.</td>', 'The soft focus doesn''t work here for me.  It just looks rather blurry and without detail.', '2005-10-28 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820829, 247495, 39664, '<td valign="top">Another incredible macro shot!</td>', 'Another incredible macro shot!', '2005-10-28 12:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820831, 247493, 39664, '<td valign="top">We have one of  these in our subdivision lake and he is so evasive.  This is an incredible capture and I can hardly wait to read the details of the shot.</td>', 'We have one of  these in our subdivision lake and he is so evasive.  This is an incredible capture and I can hardly wait to read the details of the shot.', '2005-10-28 12:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820832, 248449, 39664, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot.</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot.', '2005-10-28 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820833, 249254, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice capture!</td>', 'Wow!  Nice capture!', '2005-10-28 12:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820835, 249226, 39664, '<td valign="top">Looks like nature''s elements won!</td>', 'Looks like nature''s elements won!', '2005-10-28 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820836, 248147, 39664, '<td valign="top">Such a doll!</td>', 'Such a doll!', '2005-10-28 12:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820838, 248767, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow! Another shot of the windmill!  Excellent as ever and I love the sky.   Wonderful "fish-eye" feel to this.</td>', 'Wow! Another shot of the windmill!  Excellent as ever and I love the sky.   Wonderful "fish-eye" feel to this.', '2005-10-28 12:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820849, 249106, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t completely understand your choice of focus on this picture, it seems that your focus plane is somewhere in between objects in this frame and frankly I find it very disturbing and this is not an image I find pleasing to look at.  Colours seem good though but a bit flat, a small curves adjustment would improve this heaps.  Meets the challenge though so I gave it an 4.</td>', 'I don´t completely understand your choice of focus on this picture, it seems that your focus plane is somewhere in between objects in this frame and frankly I find it very disturbing and this is not an image I find pleasing to look at.  Colours seem good though but a bit flat, a small curves adjustment would improve this heaps.  Meets the challenge though so I gave it an 4.', '2005-10-28 12:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820853, 246954, 39664, '<td valign="top">This could have been a lot better photograph if you changed your angle and DOF so that the clump of flowers in the bottom left foreground weren''t such a huge distraction.  They are way overblown and out of focus and my eye is drawn there instead of your subject, the butterfly.</td>', 'This could have been a lot better photograph if you changed your angle and DOF so that the clump of flowers in the bottom left foreground weren''t such a huge distraction.  They are way overblown and out of focus and my eye is drawn there instead of your subject, the butterfly.', '2005-10-28 12:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820915, 246966, 32848, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this with a contrasting background rather than a matching one.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this with a contrasting background rather than a matching one.', '2005-10-28 12:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820922, 248982, 44275, '<td valign="top">This photo looks a little too sharpened. Still cool, but not as great quality.</td>', 'This photo looks a little too sharpened. Still cool, but not as great quality.', '2005-10-28 12:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820926, 249124, 44275, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture. Amazing focus.</td>', 'Awesome picture. Amazing focus.', '2005-10-28 12:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820928, 248383, 44275, '<td valign="top">Effing amazing.</td>', 'Effing amazing.', '2005-10-28 13:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820929, 249532, 40371, '<td valign="top">I really wish this wasn''t so blurry.  It is an excellent interpretation on the theme and the colors are amazing.</td>', 'I really wish this wasn''t so blurry.  It is an excellent interpretation on the theme and the colors are amazing.', '2005-10-28 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820955, 248758, 42198, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and composition. The texture is great too. But I just don''t see the ''delicate'' message in here. It''s a stone/granite cross.</td>', 'I love the angle and composition. The texture is great too. But I just don''t see the ''delicate'' message in here. It''s a stone/granite cross.', '2005-10-28 13:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820965, 249226, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is just brilliant - I love it. The tones are superb. Composition is spot-on.</td>', 'This is just brilliant - I love it. The tones are superb. Composition is spot-on.', '2005-10-28 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820967, 249549, 42198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The colours and focus/sharpness is excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful. The colours and focus/sharpness is excellent.', '2005-10-28 13:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820979, 249518, 35122, '<td valign="top">very cool picture</td>', 'very cool picture', '2005-10-28 13:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820982, 248128, 40371, '<td valign="top">Nice addition of the egg.</td>', 'Nice addition of the egg.', '2005-10-28 13:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820985, 248995, 35122, '<td valign="top">lovely shot!!!</td>', 'lovely shot!!!', '2005-10-28 13:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820986, 249321, 42198, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of humour here. Original idea. Would have been interesting to have the empty packet on the bed....!</td>', 'Nice sense of humour here. Original idea. Would have been interesting to have the empty packet on the bed....!', '2005-10-28 13:24:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1820990, 247061, 42198, '<td valign="top">It''s not very often a macro of a bug stops me in my tracks. But you managed it with this one! - Well done. Excellent composition, and focus is perfect.</td>', 'It''s not very often a macro of a bug stops me in my tracks. But you managed it with this one! - Well done. Excellent composition, and focus is perfect.', '2005-10-28 13:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821005, 247061, 35122, '<td valign="top">what an amazing shot.....very nice!!!</td>', 'what an amazing shot.....very nice!!!', '2005-10-28 13:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821008, 247921, 42198, '<td valign="top">Well, this is certainly more interesting than the usual macros of butterflies! - The subject is centered, and the focus looks a bit off. But it''s an imaginative and eclectic collection of objects put together to make this image. I find it strangely appealing.</td>', 'Well, this is certainly more interesting than the usual macros of butterflies! - The subject is centered, and the focus looks a bit off. But it''s an imaginative and eclectic collection of objects put together to make this image. I find it strangely appealing.', '2005-10-28 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821010, 249553, 40371, '<td valign="top">I really like what you have done with the lighting.  Some may find it distracting but I find it very artistic.</td>', 'I really like what you have done with the lighting.  Some may find it distracting but I find it very artistic.', '2005-10-28 13:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821012, 249476, 42198, '<td valign="top">You must have spent ages getting the lighting right on this! - Very nicely done. And interesting composition too.</td>', 'You must have spent ages getting the lighting right on this! - Very nicely done. And interesting composition too.', '2005-10-28 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821018, 248803, 40371, '<td valign="top">Great color and clairity.</td>', 'Great color and clairity.', '2005-10-28 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821021, 249476, 40371, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant, I love it.  The shadow adds so much to the dimension of the pic.  Not sure if I love the stark white background though.</td>', 'Simple and elegant, I love it.  The shadow adds so much to the dimension of the pic.  Not sure if I love the stark white background though.', '2005-10-28 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821023, 249032, 40371, '<td valign="top">I love that some of the frost is melting, it reaffirms the "delicate" theme.</td>', 'I love that some of the frost is melting, it reaffirms the "delicate" theme.', '2005-10-28 13:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821024, 248243, 40371, '<td valign="top">The color on this is outstanding!</td>', 'The color on this is outstanding!', '2005-10-28 13:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821026, 247157, 40371, '<td valign="top">I love how you focus right on the center and then fade out.</td>', 'I love how you focus right on the center and then fade out.', '2005-10-28 13:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821030, 249210, 40371, '<td valign="top">Excellent, the orange flower is brilliant and I love how you only focused on one color.</td>', 'Excellent, the orange flower is brilliant and I love how you only focused on one color.', '2005-10-28 13:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821041, 249592, 21915, '<td valign="top">top class work love the black and white treatment</td>', 'top class work love the black and white treatment', '2005-10-28 13:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821050, 248904, 40371, '<td valign="top">This is so creative, I love it.</td>', 'This is so creative, I love it.', '2005-10-28 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821052, 248484, 40371, '<td valign="top">Great picture, great title.</td>', 'Great picture, great title.', '2005-10-28 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821055, 249254, 40371, '<td valign="top">Clearly...hilarious.</td>', 'Clearly...hilarious.', '2005-10-28 13:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821058, 248283, 40371, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this a little better if there was more black space above the actual egg.  This is too centered for my taste.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this a little better if there was more black space above the actual egg.  This is too centered for my taste.', '2005-10-28 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821066, 247300, 40371, '<td valign="top">I like the incorporation of 3 different yet fragile species.</td>', 'I like the incorporation of 3 different yet fragile species.', '2005-10-28 13:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821067, 248413, 40371, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Love the color, it really pops out at you.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Love the color, it really pops out at you.', '2005-10-28 13:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821068, 249533, 40371, '<td valign="top">New twist on fragile egg picture...I love it!  Lighting is spectacular-not just the egg but how it is completely dark outside of your hands.</td>', 'New twist on fragile egg picture...I love it!  Lighting is spectacular-not just the egg but how it is completely dark outside of your hands.', '2005-10-28 13:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821074, 249224, 40371, '<td valign="top">It looks like you deliberately incorporated some noise into this, I really like it, it makes the shadows more defined.  Color is spectacular.</td>', 'It looks like you deliberately incorporated some noise into this, I really like it, it makes the shadows more defined.  Color is spectacular.', '2005-10-28 14:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821099, 247215, 29658, '<td valign="top">Is it delicate?</td>', 'Is it delicate?', '2005-10-28 14:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821100, 249554, 8455, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, though i would have loved to see more of the rose (and maybe less of the blue).  -7</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, though i would have loved to see more of the rose (and maybe less of the blue).  -7', '2005-10-28 14:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821117, 248600, 8455, '<td valign="top">I''m glad that someone put a picture of a guy in here too... being a little tired of only girls being ''delicate''...  though i don''t really think that all the motion blur adds that much to the pic.</td>', 'I''m glad that someone put a picture of a guy in here too... being a little tired of only girls being ''delicate''...  though i don''t really think that all the motion blur adds that much to the pic.', '2005-10-28 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821123, 248757, 45857, '<td valign="top">BUGS!!!! ECCCCK!!!!<br/>Comp is nice, technique is nice, its nice.    You tell me what makes it above average, why does it stand out?</td>', 'BUGS!!!! ECCCCK!!!!Comp is nice, technique is nice, its nice.    You tell me what makes it above average, why does it stand out?', '2005-10-28 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821125, 249133, 45928, '<td valign="top">The layers here are really nicely arranged and the black background really makes the shot along with the lighting. Very nice.</td>', 'The layers here are really nicely arranged and the black background really makes the shot along with the lighting. Very nice.', '2005-10-28 14:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821127, 247498, 45928, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. It may have done better in the white on white submissions, though.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. It may have done better in the white on white submissions, though.', '2005-10-28 14:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821129, 248917, 45928, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very nice. I only wish the colors were a little more vibrant, this would probly come with better lighting.</td>', 'Great shot, very nice. I only wish the colors were a little more vibrant, this would probly come with better lighting.', '2005-10-28 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
