(1821589, 249378, 45857, '<td valign="top">''at sneeze?''<br/>An interesting idea, but what makes your picture stand out?<br/>What got you excited about this image?<br/>There had to be some emotion you felt that you wanted it to emote, but I don''t share it with you.<br/></td>', '''at sneeze?''An interesting idea, but what makes your picture stand out?What got you excited about this image?There had to be some emotion you felt that you wanted it to emote, but I don''t share it with you.', '2005-10-28 17:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821596, 249245, 45857, '<td valign="top">This would have been impressive in the Personification chhallenge.<br/>Looking at it in the current challenge leaves me wanting more. Context is important.</td>', 'This would have been impressive in the Personification chhallenge.Looking at it in the current challenge leaves me wanting more. Context is important.', '2005-10-28 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821609, 248830, 45857, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and you do get your message across.<br/>However, I think you and your hand and your camera, while not disqualifiying elements, really detract from the quality of an otherwise great image. Its not the reflection challenge, but tis still something to think about.</td>', 'Interesting concept and you do get your message across.However, I think you and your hand and your camera, while not disqualifiying elements, really detract from the quality of an otherwise great image. Its not the reflection challenge, but tis still something to think about.', '2005-10-28 18:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821617, 249422, 45857, '<td valign="top">Its a nice picture of a flower, but just that.<br/>Why did you think it was excellent? What turned you on about this image, and how would you enhance it?</td>', 'Its a nice picture of a flower, but just that.Why did you think it was excellent? What turned you on about this image, and how would you enhance it?', '2005-10-28 18:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821625, 249529, 45857, '<td valign="top">Ok, its a fuzzy feather. The moiré is exciting, but why is it there?<br/>The title implies action, but the cause and effect relationship is obscurred in your picture.</td>', 'Ok, its a fuzzy feather. The moiré is exciting, but why is it there?The title implies action, but the cause and effect relationship is obscurred in your picture.', '2005-10-28 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821643, 248979, 45857, '<td valign="top">The kid says it all....<br/>Its very hard to get your viewers as excited about your kids as you are.<br/>You need to think about it as someone else child. Tough I know, but you need to maintain some objectivity when you work, if you want to be competitive.</td>', 'The kid says it all....Its very hard to get your viewers as excited about your kids as you are.You need to think about it as someone else child. Tough I know, but you need to maintain some objectivity when you work, if you want to be competitive.', '2005-10-28 18:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821644, 249553, 34759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I like that it''s different than most of the typical flower shots.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I like that it''s different than most of the typical flower shots.', '2005-10-28 18:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821646, 249210, 34759, '<td valign="top">Very effective shot. I love it!</td>', 'Very effective shot. I love it!', '2005-10-28 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821654, 249241, 45857, '<td valign="top">Old hippies never die, they just get washed away...<br/> <br/></td>', 'Old hippies never die, they just get washed away... ', '2005-10-28 18:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821660, 249422, 34759, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better if the flower hadn''t been in the exact center of the frame.</td>', 'I think this would be better if the flower hadn''t been in the exact center of the frame.', '2005-10-28 18:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821663, 249179, 34759, '<td valign="top">The blown highlights are a bit distracting. Pretty flower.</td>', 'The blown highlights are a bit distracting. Pretty flower.', '2005-10-28 18:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821664, 249232, 34759, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the contrast between the leaves and the sky. The frame is a bit overbearing for the photo in my opinion.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the contrast between the leaves and the sky. The frame is a bit overbearing for the photo in my opinion.', '2005-10-28 18:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821668, 246715, 34759, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, it''s very out of focus and the background is pretty distracting. Pretty rose though.</td>', 'Unfortunately, it''s very out of focus and the background is pretty distracting. Pretty rose though.', '2005-10-28 18:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821669, 248038, 45857, '<td valign="top">I have this image in my mind now, of you down on your hands and knees, with your tush stuck up in the air, squinting through the viewfinder and your neighbors saying "Look that crazy person is at it again !" Nice capture.</td>', 'I have this image in my mind now, of you down on your hands and knees, with your tush stuck up in the air, squinting through the viewfinder and your neighbors saying "Look that crazy person is at it again !" Nice capture.', '2005-10-28 18:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821672, 246485, 34759, '<td valign="top">Adorable. :) The white balance seems to be off a bit, which gives it a bit of a yellow cast.</td>', 'Adorable. :) The white balance seems to be off a bit, which gives it a bit of a yellow cast.', '2005-10-28 18:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821678, 249476, 45857, '<td valign="top">Uggh, Americans preoccupation with money, FDR was a pinko socialist, and I hate unicorns. That said it a rather good picture.</td>', 'Uggh, Americans preoccupation with money, FDR was a pinko socialist, and I hate unicorns. That said it a rather good picture.', '2005-10-28 18:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821679, 248048, 34759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I love how the butterfly and the little thing flower stem it''s standing on are both delicate.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I love how the butterfly and the little thing flower stem it''s standing on are both delicate.', '2005-10-28 18:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821682, 248243, 34759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors captured in the butterfly.</td>', 'Beautiful colors captured in the butterfly.', '2005-10-28 18:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821683, 249314, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I don''t find anything overly interesting about the composition.</td>', 'Nice colors, but I don''t find anything overly interesting about the composition.', '2005-10-28 18:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821685, 249605, 34759, '<td valign="top">Would be better if it had been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Would be better if it had been a bit sharper.', '2005-10-28 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821689, 247976, 34759, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like how it covers her face. I think this would have been more effective if you had shot her and the flower from the side.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like how it covers her face. I think this would have been more effective if you had shot her and the flower from the side.', '2005-10-28 18:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
