(1821700, 249414, 34759, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if the moth had a different background. This background''s a bit cluttered.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if the moth had a different background. This background''s a bit cluttered.', '2005-10-28 18:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
