(1821903, 249553, 46235, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!  I do wish the white highlights at the bottom weren''t there.  Great Job!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!  I do wish the white highlights at the bottom weren''t there.  Great Job!', '2005-10-28 20:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
