(1822053, 249460, 45857, '<td valign="top">I did a shot back in college with those exact same hands. Well, maybe not the exact hands, the ones I shot belonged to a farmer standing at a cattle auction, but close. Nice work.</td>', 'I did a shot back in college with those exact same hands. Well, maybe not the exact hands, the ones I shot belonged to a farmer standing at a cattle auction, but close. Nice work.', '2005-10-28 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822054, 249137, 43031, '<td valign="top">Okay, trying not to be harsh.<br/>First: dude, turn your date off. or at least crop it out.<br/>Second: Your composition is okay, but it needs a central subject (meaning focus point, not a subject in the middle)<br/>Third: In landscapes, horizons should be completely straight. <br/>Fourth: using bright/contrast on this could improve the color quality immensely.<br/></td>', 'Okay, trying not to be harsh.First: dude, turn your date off. or at least crop it out.Second: Your composition is okay, but it needs a central subject (meaning focus point, not a subject in the middle)Third: In landscapes, horizons should be completely straight. Fourth: using bright/contrast on this could improve the color quality immensely.', '2005-10-28 22:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
