(1822856, 249036, 37544, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful capture! I love the lighting. The amount of light comming through the clouds could not be more perfect. I am not sure if I would call this delicate. This is not what I had in mind for the theme and what it meant to me. But that doesn''t mean that it doesn''t meant the challenge. I really like this picture. Did he get wet?</td>', 'this is a wonderful capture! I love the lighting. The amount of light comming through the clouds could not be more perfect. I am not sure if I would call this delicate. This is not what I had in mind for the theme and what it meant to me. But that doesn''t mean that it doesn''t meant the challenge. I really like this picture. Did he get wet?', '2005-10-29 11:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822860, 248177, 37544, '<td valign="top">I think that the actual photo quality of this picture is very good. However, I do not think "delicate" when I see this picture. I can see where you are going with this image, but I think that it is a stretch for the theme. I think that everyone has different viewpoints on themes and I am not going to vote lower because mine view is different from yours. Nice picture of a sweet child.</td>', 'I think that the actual photo quality of this picture is very good. However, I do not think "delicate" when I see this picture. I can see where you are going with this image, but I think that it is a stretch for the theme. I think that everyone has different viewpoints on themes and I am not going to vote lower because mine view is different from yours. Nice picture of a sweet child.', '2005-10-29 11:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822863, 248044, 37544, '<td valign="top">This is a very sad image and a good idea for the theme. However, I would have shot from a different angle. The powerlines are very distracting and I think that a different viewpoint would have been better. You cannot see the girls face and in this crop she is dead center in the image, thus not very appealing.</td>', 'This is a very sad image and a good idea for the theme. However, I would have shot from a different angle. The powerlines are very distracting and I think that a different viewpoint would have been better. You cannot see the girls face and in this crop she is dead center in the image, thus not very appealing.', '2005-10-29 11:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
