(1822869, 248937, 37544, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors, I wish that the red leaf was completely on top of the clovers and the other leaf wasn''t there. I think it would be better too if the red leaf was in a corner instead of the middle bottom portion of the picture.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors, I wish that the red leaf was completely on top of the clovers and the other leaf wasn''t there. I think it would be better too if the red leaf was in a corner instead of the middle bottom portion of the picture.', '2005-10-29 11:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
