(1822903, 247475, 37544, '<td valign="top">I like the mystery feel that this picture has. I wish her feet were visible though. I am not sure if I like the grain or not. Still thinking about it.</td>', 'I like the mystery feel that this picture has. I wish her feet were visible though. I am not sure if I like the grain or not. Still thinking about it.', '2005-10-29 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822906, 247848, 37544, '<td valign="top">I like the oversaturated colors in this image. I feel that you have made an impact with the colors and make this picture pop. Not sure if I would call this delicate or not, but I do like the picture.</td>', 'I like the oversaturated colors in this image. I feel that you have made an impact with the colors and make this picture pop. Not sure if I would call this delicate or not, but I do like the picture.', '2005-10-29 11:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822909, 247595, 37544, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the purple hue on this image. Looks like you had a pretty good macro image and IMO you messed it up with too much processing. Nature is beautiful all by itself. Another suggestion would be to not have the bee in the center. I think that you zoomed in waaaaay too close because I see pixels on the flower petals. Nice capture of the bee, would love to see this picture after the challenge before you edited it.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the purple hue on this image. Looks like you had a pretty good macro image and IMO you messed it up with too much processing. Nature is beautiful all by itself. Another suggestion would be to not have the bee in the center. I think that you zoomed in waaaaay too close because I see pixels on the flower petals. Nice capture of the bee, would love to see this picture after the challenge before you edited it.', '2005-10-29 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822912, 248318, 40295, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject for this challenge, but it came out a bit dark and the piece of the tree dominates too much for my taste - especially the out of focus bright area in the foreground. The brightness is the problem to me on that not the focus. It just pulls me away from the lichen. I think a tighter crop and an angle that showed more detail in the lichen would have been better.</td>', 'Good choice of subject for this challenge, but it came out a bit dark and the piece of the tree dominates too much for my taste - especially the out of focus bright area in the foreground. The brightness is the problem to me on that not the focus. It just pulls me away from the lichen. I think a tighter crop and an angle that showed more detail in the lichen would have been better.', '2005-10-29 11:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822913, 248383, 40295, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked to have seen the entire spider - all of his legs. Otherwise a good catch.</td>', 'I think I would have liked to have seen the entire spider - all of his legs. Otherwise a good catch.', '2005-10-29 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
