(1822939, 248260, 40295, '<td valign="top">There is a balance here that is off and a bit disconerting to me. I feel like the doors/windows sould be centered - but they are not - rather you centered the image based on the ceiling it seems. Yet the reflections make me think you are standing directly in front of the doors - but if that is so then the doors and the ceiling should be balanced. Given this image I would have centered it base on the doors. As it is it just feels out of kilter to me.</td>', 'There is a balance here that is off and a bit disconerting to me. I feel like the doors/windows sould be centered - but they are not - rather you centered the image based on the ceiling it seems. Yet the reflections make me think you are standing directly in front of the doors - but if that is so then the doors and the ceiling should be balanced. Given this image I would have centered it base on the doors. As it is it just feels out of kilter to me.', '2005-10-29 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
