(1823150, 247498, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like how you can hardly see the edges of the plates up at the top. Neat effect. Also, like the overall simplicity and clean lines.</td>', 'Very nice. I like how you can hardly see the edges of the plates up at the top. Neat effect. Also, like the overall simplicity and clean lines.', '2005-10-29 14:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
