(1823968, 248497, 39349, '<td valign="top">As a father myself this shot really hits home for me. There''s something special when a child grabs hold of your hand / finger like that. I know when my two boys did it I felt like I was on top of the world.<br/> <br/>Okay about the shot. I really feel the composition here is top notch. Tones and lighting are nothing less than perfect. The only thing I can nit pick (and I''m really stretching here) is the little ones PJ''s on the right hand side. Either way what a perfect shot for this challenge, it''s done very well and really captures a great moment between a father and his child.<br/> <br/>Edit: cause I can''t spell or compose a sentence! hehe!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-03 00:04:57.</i></td>', 'As a father myself this shot really hits home for me. There''s something special when a child grabs hold of your hand / finger like that. I know when my two boys did it I felt like I was on top of the world. Okay about the shot. I really feel the composition here is top notch. Tones and lighting are nothing less than perfect. The only thing I can nit pick (and I''m really stretching here) is the little ones PJ''s on the right hand side. Either way what a perfect shot for this challenge, it''s done very well and really captures a great moment between a father and his child. Edit: cause I can''t spell or compose a sentence! hehe!', '2005-10-30 00:13:18.000000', '2005-11-03 00:04:57.000000', 1),
(1823978, 246715, 29009, '<td valign="top">I can see your idea; however, the focus is too poor to properly evaluate.</td>', 'I can see your idea; however, the focus is too poor to properly evaluate.', '2005-10-30 00:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824023, 248052, 29009, '<td valign="top">Focal point fills the frame well.  Including an adult hand or finger, or something else for scale would have helped convey your point. With a macro shot like this, clipping the fingernails is essential.   Good use of depth of field, although there is some lost focus on the thumb.  Overall, a decent shot -- good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Focal point fills the frame well.  Including an adult hand or finger, or something else for scale would have helped convey your point. With a macro shot like this, clipping the fingernails is essential.   Good use of depth of field, although there is some lost focus on the thumb.  Overall, a decent shot -- good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-30 00:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824102, 249543, 2700, '<td valign="top">the sheets look faded, and don''t "bounce" out... the whole photo is rather bland, with some level editing in photoshop, the sheets would provide even more contrast with the subject..</td>', 'the sheets look faded, and don''t "bounce" out... the whole photo is rather bland, with some level editing in photoshop, the sheets would provide even more contrast with the subject..', '2005-10-30 01:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
