(1824447, 248767, 19978, '<td valign="top">Oh my. Perfection in photography. Begs for a largish print, don''t it? An eye for composition was poised behind the camera on this occasion.</td>', 'Oh my. Perfection in photography. Begs for a largish print, don''t it? An eye for composition was poised behind the camera on this occasion.', '2005-10-30 08:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824448, 249345, 19978, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful candid. This pic has a wonderful feel to it. On an emotional level, it begs the viewer to ask questions. Who is she? Why is she smiling? What just happened. I love photos like this. Bravo.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful candid. This pic has a wonderful feel to it. On an emotional level, it begs the viewer to ask questions. Who is she? Why is she smiling? What just happened. I love photos like this. Bravo.', '2005-10-30 08:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824450, 249468, 19978, '<td valign="top">A superb composition and idea, but oh, don''t use flash! Light it obliquely from both sides to fill in the shadows.</td>', 'A superb composition and idea, but oh, don''t use flash! Light it obliquely from both sides to fill in the shadows.', '2005-10-30 08:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824452, 248825, 19978, '<td valign="top">May I have some please?? A wonderful compositional idea. The moisture on the skin is a bit sloppy feeling, but it gets the job done.</td>', 'May I have some please?? A wonderful compositional idea. The moisture on the skin is a bit sloppy feeling, but it gets the job done.', '2005-10-30 08:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824453, 248881, 19978, '<td valign="top">There are soooo many things about this photo that just work. The crop is genius. The lighting is unbelievably perfect. It looks so effortless but I bet you worked at it. The beautiful background tone and gradient really makes it. I hope you sell this baby. Make some money. Make a name for yourself.</td>', 'There are soooo many things about this photo that just work. The crop is genius. The lighting is unbelievably perfect. It looks so effortless but I bet you worked at it. The beautiful background tone and gradient really makes it. I hope you sell this baby. Make some money. Make a name for yourself.', '2005-10-30 08:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824475, 249483, 46235, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  It looks lika painting.  Very nice job.</td>', 'I love this photo!  It looks lika painting.  Very nice job.', '2005-10-30 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824490, 248928, 45885, '<td valign="top">Nice sunrise/set! but how is this delicate?</td>', 'Nice sunrise/set! but how is this delicate?', '2005-10-30 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824505, 249106, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, but I would like to see a sharper image, more in focus. Great idea and great for the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great image, but I would like to see a sharper image, more in focus. Great idea and great for the challenge.', '2005-10-30 09:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824528, 248758, 19035, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but to me doesnt represent Delicate, the cross is made of stone, and to me my faith is my strength.  I dont want to sound judgementle, because Im sure you had a reason to find this to be delicate in your mind.  Good luck on the challenge, I look forward to seeing what you have in your comments on this.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but to me doesnt represent Delicate, the cross is made of stone, and to me my faith is my strength.  I dont want to sound judgementle, because Im sure you had a reason to find this to be delicate in your mind.  Good luck on the challenge, I look forward to seeing what you have in your comments on this.', '2005-10-30 10:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824531, 248982, 19035, '<td valign="top">good idea, but a bit over sharpened</td>', 'good idea, but a bit over sharpened', '2005-10-30 10:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824533, 248042, 19035, '<td valign="top">oh my goodness, they are both so beautiful, great job on a tender portrait  9</td>', 'oh my goodness, they are both so beautiful, great job on a tender portrait  9', '2005-10-30 10:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824537, 248799, 19035, '<td valign="top">i love the textures in this photo</td>', 'i love the textures in this photo', '2005-10-30 10:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824546, 246569, 19035, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful indeed, I like the texture in the wings.  I see a few fragments in the image, but otherwise a fantastic capture that meets the chalenge well  . 8  .</td>', 'Very beautiful indeed, I like the texture in the wings.  I see a few fragments in the image, but otherwise a fantastic capture that meets the chalenge well  . 8  .', '2005-10-30 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824549, 248495, 19035, '<td valign="top">a bit tight on the cropping, otherwise a great photo, colors, sharpness, emotion - all well done.  Good luck  .  7  .</td>', 'a bit tight on the cropping, otherwise a great photo, colors, sharpness, emotion - all well done.  Good luck  .  7  .', '2005-10-30 10:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824552, 248283, 19035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - one of my top pics  .  9  .</td>', 'Wonderful - one of my top pics  .  9  .', '2005-10-30 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824555, 249328, 19035, '<td valign="top">this looks anything but delicate - very nice action sports shot - but doesnt seem to meet the chalenge, unless Im missing something.</td>', 'this looks anything but delicate - very nice action sports shot - but doesnt seem to meet the chalenge, unless Im missing something.', '2005-10-30 10:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824562, 246849, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is not a super-attractive pose, although the model does appear to have a nice figure.  Black bra + white shirt does not convey delicate.  This shot is out of focus and the background is distracting.  There is something in the lower left side of the frame that looks like it was not cropped out as you intended.  Overall, the model is pretty but this shot looks more like a personal snapshot than an artistic interpretation of "delicate."</td>', 'This is not a super-attractive pose, although the model does appear to have a nice figure.  Black bra + white shirt does not convey delicate.  This shot is out of focus and the background is distracting.  There is something in the lower left side of the frame that looks like it was not cropped out as you intended.  Overall, the model is pretty but this shot looks more like a personal snapshot than an artistic interpretation of "delicate."', '2005-10-30 10:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824571, 248812, 19035, '<td valign="top">she looks pretty tough to me...nice sports action shot - sorry - dont see delicate here.</td>', 'she looks pretty tough to me...nice sports action shot - sorry - dont see delicate here.', '2005-10-30 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824579, 249586, 41183, '<td valign="top">cool picccccc</td>', 'cool picccccc', '2005-10-30 10:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824590, 248260, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment and bumping up.  At first blush, this shot does not convey "delicate" as well as some of the others in the challenge.  It is; however, technically competent with the exception of slightly skewed perspective (not all of the lines are straight).  Overall, a visually interesting shot.</td>', 'Returning for comment and bumping up.  At first blush, this shot does not convey "delicate" as well as some of the others in the challenge.  It is; however, technically competent with the exception of slightly skewed perspective (not all of the lines are straight).  Overall, a visually interesting shot.', '2005-10-30 11:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824612, 249386, 29009, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would have never connected this shot with "delicate."  This is a very busy composition - using depth of field would have helped the viewer isolate a focal point.</td>', 'Without the title, I would have never connected this shot with "delicate."  This is a very busy composition - using depth of field would have helped the viewer isolate a focal point.', '2005-10-30 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824643, 248794, 35444, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, I love the lighting, her expression and the burst of red.</td>', 'A beautiful shot, I love the lighting, her expression and the burst of red.', '2005-10-30 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824662, 248225, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Could use a bit more contrast to give some more pop/</td>', 'Great shot! Could use a bit more contrast to give some more pop/', '2005-10-30 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
