(1830730, 249539, 36832, '<td valign="top">I think people may have a difficult time seeing this as delicate, but as a photo, I do like it for it''s simplicity.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think people may have a difficult time seeing this as delicate, but as a photo, I do like it for it''s simplicity.  Good luck.', '2005-11-01 18:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830743, 249139, 45832, '<td valign="top">a red-assed baboon?</td>', 'a red-assed baboon?', '2005-11-01 18:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830747, 249321, 36832, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea--yes, virginity (or the loss of) is definitely a very delicate subject.  I like the concept, and I see you''ve put thought into the photo.  It may be more effective though if you the photo simple...keep the prophylactic and maybe one or two articles of clothing but maybe a different (solid) background.  Just a thought, but like I said, clever idea.  Good luck to you!</td>', 'Very clever idea--yes, virginity (or the loss of) is definitely a very delicate subject.  I like the concept, and I see you''ve put thought into the photo.  It may be more effective though if you the photo simple...keep the prophylactic and maybe one or two articles of clothing but maybe a different (solid) background.  Just a thought, but like I said, clever idea.  Good luck to you!', '2005-11-01 18:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830748, 247253, 45832, '<td valign="top">angle makes fingers oddly out of proportion</td>', 'angle makes fingers oddly out of proportion', '2005-11-01 18:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830754, 249139, 36832, '<td valign="top">I certainly appreciate the humor!  I bet yours is more pink than mine too!  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'I certainly appreciate the humor!  I bet yours is more pink than mine too!  :)  Good luck.', '2005-11-01 18:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830765, 248044, 36832, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has the potential to convey more than what the challenge is about, but I wish it had been taken at a different angle or view.  The telephone lines are a bit disctracting and takes away from the story of the subject.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think this photo has the potential to convey more than what the challenge is about, but I wish it had been taken at a different angle or view.  The telephone lines are a bit disctracting and takes away from the story of the subject.  Good luck.', '2005-11-01 18:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830779, 249328, 36832, '<td valign="top">Every time I see this photo, I laugh.  Not because of the actual photo itself, but because of the title.  To see a rough and tough sport such as rugby and these huge dirty guys tackling each other--I think that they''re anything but delicate!  If it were for humor alone, I would score this a perfect 10!!!  Thanks for keeping a sense of humor.</td>', 'Every time I see this photo, I laugh.  Not because of the actual photo itself, but because of the title.  To see a rough and tough sport such as rugby and these huge dirty guys tackling each other--I think that they''re anything but delicate!  If it were for humor alone, I would score this a perfect 10!!!  Thanks for keeping a sense of humor.', '2005-11-01 19:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830788, 249317, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity, comp, and choice of color.  Nicely done.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the simplicity, comp, and choice of color.  Nicely done.  Good luck.', '2005-11-01 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830796, 248825, 45832, '<td valign="top">The liquid water is places where it would not naturally be had the ice melted where it rests.</td>', 'The liquid water is places where it would not naturally be had the ice melted where it rests.', '2005-11-01 19:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830804, 249589, 36832, '<td valign="top">I think this is beautiful...especially how the rest of the flower/plant fades in the background but looks almost like it''s glowing.  Would have scored it higher but the bottom right corner of the photo where the other branch appears detracts from the overall focus.  I''d love to see this without that second branch.  Good luck to you.</td>', 'I think this is beautiful...especially how the rest of the flower/plant fades in the background but looks almost like it''s glowing.  Would have scored it higher but the bottom right corner of the photo where the other branch appears detracts from the overall focus.  I''d love to see this without that second branch.  Good luck to you.', '2005-11-01 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830810, 249468, 36832, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of the photo and use of negative space.  Very well done.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the crispness of the photo and use of negative space.  Very well done.  Good luck.', '2005-11-01 19:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1830812, 249361, 10634, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this is the only one of these I have seen. Good Luck</td>', 'I am surprised this is the only one of these I have seen. Good Luck', '2005-11-01 19:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
