(1830869, 247976, 36832, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The one thing that I wish the subject had done (if this photo is staged which I think it is) is direct her gaze towards the flower.  I think the subject is smelling the flower and it would make the photo more authentic if her gaze were directed towards it.  7</td>', 'Nicely done.  The one thing that I wish the subject had done (if this photo is staged which I think it is) is direct her gaze towards the flower.  I think the subject is smelling the flower and it would make the photo more authentic if her gaze were directed towards it.  7', '2005-11-01 19:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
