(1833285, 247962, 7485, '<td valign="top">It''s photos like this one that makes me wonder why I still bother with DPC. This is simply a great photo, and it fits the challenge beautifully. Even accounting for some people who don''t get it, I would still have expected it to be at least in the top 20. When something this artistically done doesn''t get appreciated then it may be time to move to a site with higher standards. But I for one am certainly putting you on my favorites list!</td>', 'It''s photos like this one that makes me wonder why I still bother with DPC. This is simply a great photo, and it fits the challenge beautifully. Even accounting for some people who don''t get it, I would still have expected it to be at least in the top 20. When something this artistically done doesn''t get appreciated then it may be time to move to a site with higher standards. But I for one am certainly putting you on my favorites list!', '2005-11-02 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1833309, 249197, 7485, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, talk about underrated! I didn''t get a chance to comment before, but I loved the simplicity and thought it fit the challenge beautifully. Only suggestion would be to brighten the highlights just a bit, to draw more attention to the puff of white.</td>', 'Sheesh, talk about underrated! I didn''t get a chance to comment before, but I loved the simplicity and thought it fit the challenge beautifully. Only suggestion would be to brighten the highlights just a bit, to draw more attention to the puff of white.', '2005-11-02 13:43:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1833333, 249435, 7485, '<td valign="top">And I thought this one would definitely do well! Beautifully simple, perfectly lit, and fits the challenge so well, what else could these silly DPCers want? Well, this one is certainly going on my favorites list.</td>', 'And I thought this one would definitely do well! Beautifully simple, perfectly lit, and fits the challenge so well, what else could these silly DPCers want? Well, this one is certainly going on my favorites list.', '2005-11-02 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1833337, 249516, 18932, '<td valign="top">This is a gift that just keeps on giving! The colours are gorgeous, the composition stunning - there''s so much to look at and yet none of it competes with or distracts from the rest. The girl looks perfect for this sort of shot, and the focus is great with just the right amount of softness. I didn''t vote on this challenge but I hope I would have had the sense to give this a 10 like 41 other voters did. The other voters clearly don''t know one end of the camera from the other! (just kidding about the last bit) Seriously though, this is a great photo by any measure, tells a great story.</td>', 'This is a gift that just keeps on giving! The colours are gorgeous, the composition stunning - there''s so much to look at and yet none of it competes with or distracts from the rest. The girl looks perfect for this sort of shot, and the focus is great with just the right amount of softness. I didn''t vote on this challenge but I hope I would have had the sense to give this a 10 like 41 other voters did. The other voters clearly don''t know one end of the camera from the other! (just kidding about the last bit) Seriously though, this is a great photo by any measure, tells a great story.', '2005-11-02 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
