(1835248, 248630, 35517, '<td valign="top">HEYA Katie... so great to see you here.... great shot for your first challenge, and you have done so well.. congrats..... so do you get the hand-me-downs do you?..lol... hope to see you in Nov...</td>', 'HEYA Katie... so great to see you here.... great shot for your first challenge, and you have done so well.. congrats..... so do you get the hand-me-downs do you?..lol... hope to see you in Nov...', '2005-11-03 02:30:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1835425, 248767, 22781, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Azrifel:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh yes, let is snow, let is snow and us Dutchies will kill the competition here with our snowscape night long exposures of friggin windmills! :)<br/> <br/>Good idea that. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Az, have you''ve been sniffing that vodka bottle again ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by Azrifel: Oh yes, let is snow, let is snow and us Dutchies will kill the competition here with our snowscape night long exposures of friggin windmills! :) Good idea that. ;)   Az, have you''ve been sniffing that vodka bottle again ;)', '2005-11-03 07:55:03.000000', NULL, 0),
