(1842730, 249317, 42100, '<td valign="top">Your photo definately says delicate, I guess i really didn''t notice the pixelizing in the background when I voted.  This photo just seemed a little flat to me.  I think it could of benefited from more contrast since its a monochromatic photo.</td>', 'Your photo definately says delicate, I guess i really didn''t notice the pixelizing in the background when I voted.  This photo just seemed a little flat to me.  I think it could of benefited from more contrast since its a monochromatic photo.', '2005-11-06 19:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
